{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53463","headline":"同窦羣雪中寓直（题拟） · 韦贯之","name":"同窦羣雪中寓直（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耿耿风雪暮，直庐未掩扉。\n咏兰幽助兴，俪玉粲相辉。\n气劲琴韵切，夜深鑪火微。\n虽殊江海远，即此恋彤闱。\n（见《窦氏联珠集》。\n题下原署「吏部员外郎韦贯之」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦贯之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}